<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-spŭo</span></b> , spŭi,
		3, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i>, <i>to spit into</i> or <i>upon</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alicui in frontem mediam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 3, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in faciem alicujus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Cons. ad Helv. 13</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid oculis jumentorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					31, 9, 45, § 105</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 22, 21, 25, § 52</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
